{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d5d6006945d280a840","chatId":"f234afc63b8d4463820d124682156257","sessionId":null,"userId":69011,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1162,"promptTokens":1469,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:29"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690283172824024,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d5d6006945d280a83f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369749744,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d5d6006945d280a83f","chatId":"f234afc63b8d4463820d124682156257","sessionId":null,"userId":69011,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小丽的同学因为她成绩好而不喜欢她。上周，他们班级有一次非常难的化学考试。当试卷分数出来时，小丽意识到她是班级唯一一个及格的。所以，她马上撕掉试卷，然后扔掉以免其他人看见。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小丽最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 自豪\nB) 紧张\nC) 绝望\nD) 生气\nE) 感激\nF) 惊喜\n\n## 问题 2\n小丽为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 小丽担心如果同学们发现她是唯一一个及格的人，他们会更讨厌她\nB) 她没有为考试做准备\nC) 小丽无意中撕破了她的试卷\nD) 她不知道考试的答案","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690283172824024,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d5d6006945d280a840","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369749741,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"8945595dbd694279b13f1295003d5b24"}